description=Open-source IMS (PhhIms) for VoLTE and SMS over IMS on the Galaxy S20 FE Snapdragon (r8q), Android 17 and 16. Tested with o2 (DE), ONDO (MN), VIVACOM and A1 (BG), Turkcell and Vodafone (TR) and Jio (IN); testers wanted. Action button shows the VoLTE status. Boot-loop protected, log: /data/adb/phhims-volte.log
